{"Version":3,"Type":0,"FileReferences":{"Moc":"2f385dfa541077c4f190b9931cc662b3.bin3","Textures":["fa74cff6076e35a8d800bbf394cf2cac.bin3"],"Physics":"1f83525463e0ee83e08e6058ddaf5736.bin3","PhysicsV2":{"File":"1f83525463e0ee83e08e6058ddaf5736.bin3"},"Motions":{"Idle":[{"File":"2c54b3652c3df1c9243e929d454cabb2.bin3","Interruptable":true}],"Tap":[{"File":"307f2627c01f8a649418c8f8852e96da.bin3","Sound":"9734c59295bd8dbceec66f7efcc51787.bin3","Text":"この中に女神、貴族、紅魔族、転生者がいたら、あたしのところに来なさい。以上。","TextDuration":8000,"MotionDuration":8000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"68772ae1c6362a6a461138ecb54d0176.bin3","Sound":"222a966e37afa3fb5c4b305642db246a.bin3","Text":"SOS団異世界デビューよ！　あたしがこの世界を大いに盛り上げてあげる！","TextDuration":6000,"MotionDuration":6000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"43b3063ac1c6ca969cc207917e744d5b.bin3","Sound":"bf2885165d99f21e603827727704249e.bin3","Text":"さあ、次のクエスト行きましょう！　時間は有限なんだから、今やるのよ！","TextDuration":6000,"MotionDuration":6000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"3a73f4c822f3974fc98c23c9104ddebc.bin3","Sound":"511c721674c70a7f7109284cd76901c3.bin3","Text":"キョンもカズマも辛気臭い顔してるわね。せっかくの異世界なのにどうしたのかしら？","TextDuration":7000,"MotionDuration":7000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"3ccf8329967d1b6778dfc9734b391796.bin3","Sound":"085c1fa192ada4da0e8eadbd8bb39345.bin3","Text":"この世界も大いに盛り上げてやるんだから。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"4259f174e967c8d0146afb8c09ec4766.bin3","Sound":"efbe557078fda07255098c1d790c727e.bin3","Text":"SOS団にはヒーラーが足りないわね．．．どこかにいないかしら。","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"124b98111fc6bff2fa04cdf5137287f4.bin3","Sound":"cd2e90b908c9c1c20a062f9d09cc732d.bin3","Text":"アクアの芸ってすごいのよ、本当にタネも仕掛けもないの！","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"4bf06699359576dceba963b4e786a281.bin3","Sound":"de38a045ce25ed72c2236eccccb40eed.bin3","Text":"クエストに行く時間ね、キョンを捕まえてこなきゃ。","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"67415473f2c2497cca90f7782fbedf92.bin3","Sound":"c7d231e88bc0af34de7b87463447e260.bin3","Text":"ここはあっちみたいにつまんない世界じゃないみたい！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"19b60fe2657932259e508afcd15c5f54.bin3","Sound":"d10719f0c37acd8d185e50364307152f.bin3","Text":"みくるちゃんに着せるビキニアーマーがないなら、自分で作ればいいじゃない！","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"ba706acad4f9f1289f95524f51d9b439.bin3","Sound":"195aec575bea1ae74c8d7bee702eabd8.bin3","Text":"変わったことがいっぱいで、本当に楽しいところよね！","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"0b181dace0f59ca5f186904d6990e170.bin3","Sound":"2474ae2d35a0d79938df6babe56ffd29.bin3","Text":"異世界があるって信じてよかったわ。そうでないと叶うものも叶わなくなるからね。","TextDuration":7000,"MotionDuration":7000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"0acaecd79ebbeb9bdf077d1d8cb8939b.bin3","Sound":"66d81bfab3632d4e91e24a9279806539.bin3","Text":"ドラゴンを倒せる王女様がいるって聞いたわ、会いに行きましょう！","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"72d07bddb04a30a17af4584ce225b50a.bin3","Sound":"52c451401015357d860e4237f10a3bb6.bin3","Text":"1匹くらいなら、ジャイアントトードを飼ってみたいわね。","TextDuration":6000,"MotionDuration":6000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"bfa20434496e161e0584b14c6951dd44.bin3","Sound":"d36ee14920153c3cff694363c1f8c1e2.bin3","Text":"爆裂魔法ってすごい技よね、有希にも覚えてもらわなきゃ。","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"194694e68328cb1f00915efcc78abb61.bin3","Sound":"f6981ba35f5caf2de2ff2941204e1b6d.bin3","Text":"ダクネスとみくるちゃんが組めば、人気が出そうなのよね．．．。","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"66f4dd771d8e8cfc063747d8f8a25a6a.bin3","Sound":"c0f498652b96bd53de5ae26460a798e9.bin3","Text":"獣人族がいるらしいわね。SOS団にスカウトしなきゃ！","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"96d2100c1a4e0a01a30e92ad5c21e587.bin3","Sound":"1175f31eca4b5a3922144343239599bb.bin3","Text":"超冒険者として、王様に挨拶くらいはしておきたいわ。","TextDuration":5000,"MotionDuration":5000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"244696f6b369729c05468470794d2f49.bin3","Sound":"abbe09908e748bd2ab4b82a92059b1bc.bin3","Text":"ポニーテール萌え？　何言ってんのよ。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"1f199d5433f326981bd89d7083ac9ef1.bin3","Sound":"f5df79c7d3db3a58423adc406ab4438f.bin3","Text":"SOS団団長、涼宮ハルヒよ！ただの人間には興味ないけど、ここなら大丈夫そう！","TextDuration":7000,"MotionDuration":7000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"fecce29ed08ce7e55c31c2e97eb4b537.bin3","Sound":"edffae95e7eb1c42cd220e870b45dbe7.bin3","Text":"どれくらいレベルが上がったかしら。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"ec41dc62f6b0aaab8f1a8cd7877ec456.bin3","Sound":"db2f388a95be20f7ead882d749a6b9ff.bin3","Text":"こんなところでどう？","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"e8f9b22613f7ecbf8b938a3a0db78197.bin3","Sound":"970aed7ea28e209a7c8480171b9113c2.bin3","Text":"なんだか退屈ね。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"004599eeca25e6cb484b7858bf108a4b.bin3","Sound":"80f4881edf43b37d31ebafc15291f65a.bin3","Text":"さーて、やるわよ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"f4ce2352dc82e5bd94da9e349ff3ebea.bin3","Sound":"8aa9fcae5448a2712aaae9d7a9ea3590.bin3","Text":"限界なんてないんだから！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"e29b00a0faf41bc572647eefea3c46d2.bin3","Sound":"8765f24091621f9237121baeeb9aba8d.bin3","Text":"そろそろ魔王を倒しに行きたいんだけど。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"def9e37476a2ad6d83edfe69b062ed13.bin3","Sound":"6ed94b10ba0890b45c79608ff13aac1f.bin3","Text":"この先には何があるのかしら！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"dbf5b12a3e72dc57029261c15b3725c9.bin3","Sound":"4f1c673fa82c62d897e3bec1783ab263.bin3","Text":"もっともっと進みましょう！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"0b39f06ba25e0f0a482b9775b08daf43.bin3","Sound":"60ad889bdb75e68a5c60913e93e365cf.bin3","Text":"あたしは負けることが大嫌いなの！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"f50bf16157d55a1842f25ffd29f09c1b.bin3","Sound":"913f3d2f979ff85f1e01618c94080518.bin3","Text":"かかってきなさい！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"40ac1aa2012321305af984ecfec6b56a.bin3","Sound":"914f49d667ad0fb03571977b26492952.bin3","Text":"この調子ね！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"de9435c01ff7e7734302da0a324a6c3f.bin3","Sound":"f582295564ec91626d7eb28e73608bde.bin3","Text":"あたしスゴイ。グレートジョブ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"b818fdb8b37b2b09349f61b339180263.bin3","Sound":"d4eceb7aae0fbae81943cda2fb17ef28.bin3","Text":"あんたのせいよ！　最悪！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"26d554d046ba4e2d7d6b3853767e104e.bin3","Sound":"15de45e00011069368b345a7902524f5.bin3","Text":"何を言おうとそれは言い訳ね。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"f5c631fc0619e5824fd66f8d8db62fce.bin3","Sound":"98843947c5ff5e22dfafbf819fbdd573.bin3","Text":"たあっ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"7c5debe6a7ed05bdf0bea7477506327e.bin3","Sound":"9ca24597c769d10d43e54065b6ea2502.bin3","Text":"えいっ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"7d47778bde82c8a19b7336db707e1370.bin3","Sound":"c233970aec78f4ce799ae0cf9bf1d9b0.bin3","Text":"いい感じ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"aae18975d4b09ed6fd06947b6fa8696f.bin3","Sound":"5fedcf217cee1af8c5490a26ab6725e4.bin3","Text":"くらいなさい！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"c0d6199acd202c296d22a09b6f615ca4.bin3","Sound":"dcc582c789494f3025ebf6f7de68958f.bin3","Text":"出来るわよ。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"71910c6825f9e45a847a224355ae166a.bin3","Sound":"6affb9637a1fbf5096f6a5ff68149ae7.bin3","Text":"行きなさい！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"ba49dc24c5deecf9a1d136992611ed3f.bin3","Sound":"78007104ade68342804972a4e0c84899.bin3","Text":"見せてあげる！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"0aba77efb07bffaae783f8128fbcb4ec.bin3","Sound":"43a84dbf75704f9e38b5f0363814a9c4.bin3","Text":"うっ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"d39b693ff639810dec40155b0612ff93.bin3","Sound":"1d0fbf99b4250a7553376f4ed8c0a95a.bin3","Text":"つまんないわね。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"34c2952c280357fedc64611f4835c795.bin3","Sound":"c21c17bc27bb7e39dc07f17892718c60.bin3","Text":"こんなのカンタンよ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"5aa2b5586be364e6bbcae6e92b093fda.bin3","Sound":"f5fc679ebb68ed08a3897f6d68ade0df.bin3","Text":"まだまだよ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"dbffda00475c9bbd41005d5b3eae265b.bin3","Sound":"9b4e7fabb66444d8c31c8aa8e0cfa1ef.bin3","Text":"何ボサっとしてんのよ！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"f93b709df8dac7082820b668b545938b.bin3","Sound":"1ea7774f44ab0bdeec92b5b672819f30.bin3","Text":"楽しそうね！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"0500f2756bae210fff80000125d938f1.bin3","Sound":"9f4924a57e63f43743a8e438b1f913b8.bin3","Text":"ふーん、悪くないんじゃない？","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"fb144fcad70a6fff7c67558cab80354f.bin3","Sound":"cde0add11e6a3dbe43e0b089f5a17cbf.bin3","Text":"なかなか見どころがあるじゃない、気に入ったわ！","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"dd93e36a98e222754f859fc2220441c8.bin3","Sound":"2bb51acabb9af061aaa8d360faf51769.bin3","Text":"超冒険者パーティーの完成ね！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"8dc2035fecdb5acf62ac1aa58f53895d.bin3","Sound":"63c6470cd673bdad2920e5741a79d7a8.bin3","Text":"SOS団の新メンバーも探さなきゃ。","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"8801534ed0d9a6eed28ee8277da7720e.bin3","Sound":"f52c4456443e1046a7fbee6fd0b5574f.bin3","Text":"アクセル以外の街も見ておかないといけないわね。","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"433874af60d470f88b8c8d4f4f40aa3d.bin3","Sound":"871645b00bcecb497abdcb067cf8cabb.bin3","Text":"はー、 毎日本当に退屈しないわ！","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"34436de687d8bb648193e07daaf5bfa4.bin3","Sound":"7d928de21bcc6d9c96a1698999db35de.bin3","Text":"アルカンレティアってところに面白い人達がいるらしいわ！","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"5bc39ceb3ea40bfcf5f316659818b8c5.bin3","Sound":"a7cbeaab50cba074585129af348c1384.bin3","Text":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！ファンタスティックデイズ","TextDuration":4000,"MotionDuration":4000,"Interruptable":true},{"File":"ed3662a11094271cbe5d19f8403a3814.bin3","Sound":"4dd8095a9dfa49d01ac6100d2b4ae577.bin3","Text":"このすば！","TextDuration":3000,"MotionDuration":3000,"Interruptable":true}]}},"Controllers":{"ParamHit":{},"ParamLoop":{},"KeyTrigger":{},"ParamTrigger":{},"AreaTrigger":{},"HandTrigger":{},"EyeBlink":{"MinInterval":500,"MaxInterval":6000,"Enabled":true},"LipSync":{"Gain":5.0,"Enabled":true},"MouseTracking":{"SmoothTime":0.15,"Enabled":true},"AutoBreath":{"Enabled":true},"ExtraMotion":{"Enabled":true},"Accelerometer":{"Enabled":true},"Microphone":{},"Transform":{},"FaceTracking":{"Enabled":true},"HandTracking":{},"ParamValue":{},"PartOpacity":{},"ArtmeshOpacity":{},"ArtmeshColor":{},"ArtmeshCulling":{"DefaultMode":0},"IntimacySystem":{}},"Options":{"ScaleFactor":0.0005,"TexFixed":true}}